            B.q("ai-m2-10", "ai-aks", "How should the Deployment manifest supply the value?", listOf("A build argument, passed with docker build --build-arg TRACKING_REGION=eu", "A node label tracking-region=eu, which pods on that node get as an env variable", "An annotation on the Deployment, which Kubernetes copies into each container's environment", "A ConfigMap, read by the container through env valueFrom configMapKeyRef"), setOf(3), "A ConfigMap holds non-secret settings as key-value pairs in the cluster, and a container reads them as environment variables through configMapKeyRef or envFrom. After you change the ConfigMap, restart the pods (for example kubectl rollout restart deployment/parcel-api) and they pick up the new value without a new image.",
