            B.q("ai-m2-30", "ai-pgvector", "Five million note embeddings will be bulk-loaded tonight and an HNSW index built. Which two steps make the index build fast and well laid out? Select two.", listOf("Create the index first, then load the rows", "Load all the rows first, then create the index", "Raise maintenance_work_mem for the session that builds the index", "Set hnsw.ef_search to 1,000 before building"), setOf(1, 2), "Building after loading is faster and gives a better index layout. Index builds use maintenance_work_mem; when the graph fits in it the build runs much faster.",
