            B.q("ai-m2-32", "ai-redis", "A learner edits a lesson. In which order should the API update the database and the cached copy, so a concurrent reader cannot put the old value back into the cache?", listOf("Delete the cache key, then update the database", "Update the cache with the new value, then the database", "Only update the database and let the key expire", "Update the database first, then delete the cache key"), setOf(3), "Writing the database first and then deleting the key means any reader that misses afterwards loads the new value. Deleting first leaves a gap in which a reader can miss, load the old row from the database, and cache it again.",
