            B.q("ai-m2-33", "ai-redis", "The home screen needs 40 cached values and the API sends 40 separate GET commands one after another, each waiting for its reply. What cuts the latency most?", listOf("Read all 40 in one round trip with MGET", "Give every key a longer expiry so reads stay cached", "Move the cache to the Flash Optimized tier", "Switch the client connection to the RESP3 protocol"), setOf(0), "Each command that waits for its reply pays a network round trip. MGET reads many keys in one command, and a pipeline sends many commands before reading the replies, so 40 round trips become one.",
