            B.q("ai-m2-39", "ai-servicebus", "Route jobs pile up every morning. How do you raise throughput without processing any job twice?", listOf("Create a topic with one subscription per worker instance", "Run more worker instances that all receive from the same queue in peek-lock mode", "Enable sessions and send every job with the same session id", "Switch the workers to ReceiveAndDelete mode"), setOf(1), "This is the competing consumers pattern: many receivers read one queue, and each message is locked by and delivered to only one of them, so adding instances adds parallel work without duplicates.",
